Third-party notices
====================

Cumulus://Mail can optionally load two v2fly routing datasets. They are not
shipped in git. `npm run geo:fetch` downloads them into `.data/geo` and checks
each file against the official .sha256sum asset and scripts/geo/geo.lock.json.

These sets are the only geo data this product uses. Loyalsoldier and sing-box
distributions are GPL-3 and are not included.

